  <prompt>Fix the design §10.1 Phase 0 BFF items 1b, 2, 4, 5a and 6 exactly as verified in `projects/spaarke-intake-pipeline-r1/notes/section10-verification-2026-11-25.md`, with a regression test for 5a. This task and task 006 ship as ONE PR (owner: no hygiene-only PRs); 006 commits on top of this branch.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in the BFF jobs framework (IJobHandler, JobContract, DI modules) and the AI consumer catalogue. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>
  <goal>The three dead handlers are gone with their DI lines, tests and diagnostics entries; StartupDiagnostics' expected list equals the registered handler JobTypes; the profile doc describes the direct-Action spine; both `DocAnalysis:{id}` enqueue sites use `AppOnlyDocumentAnalysisJobHandler.ProfileIdempotencyKey(documentId)` with MaxAttempts 3 and a regression test proves one profile; ConsumerTypes has `agreement-classify`, `nda-review` and (if its Binding row exists) `nda-standard-summary` in `All`.</goal>

